        <ns1:IAO_0000112>an annotation of gene X to cell commitment with results_in_commitment_to CL:0000540 (neuron) means that at the end of the process an unspecified cell has been specified and determined to develop into a neuron.</ns1:IAO_0000112>
        <ns1:IAO_0000115>p &apos;results in commitment to&apos; c if and only if p is a developmental process and c is a cell and p results in the state of c changing such that is can only develop into a single cell type.</ns1:IAO_0000115>
