        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002578"/>
        <ns1:IAO_0000115>p directly negatively regulates q iff p is immediately causally upstream of q, and p negatively regulates q.</ns1:IAO_0000115>
