        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0004010"/>
        <ns1:IAO_0000115>Relates a gene to condition, such that a mutation in this gene predisposes to the development of a condition  and that is necessary but not sufficient to develop the condition[modified from orphanet].</ns1:IAO_0000115>
