        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0012004"/>
        <ns1:IAO_0000115>a relation between a continuant and a process, in which the continuant is a small molecule that activates the process</ns1:IAO_0000115>
