        <ns1:IAO_0000115>A fatty alcohol consisting of a chain of 3 to greater than 27 carbon atoms in which a hydroxy group is attached to a saturated carbon atom different from the terminal carbons. Secondary fatty alcohols may be saturated or unsaturated and may be branched or unbranched.</ns1:IAO_0000115>
        <ns2:hasOBONamespace>chebi_ontology</ns2:hasOBONamespace>
        <ns2:hasRelatedSynonym>a secondary fatty alcohol</ns2:hasRelatedSynonym>
