        <ns1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A contact dermatitis that is an allergic skin reaction to foreign chemical or substances leading to red, itchy, weepy reaction where the skin has come into contact with a substance that the immune system recognizes as foreign.</ns1:IAO_0000115>
