        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <ns1:IAO_0000115>The process whose specific outcome is the progression of an organismal system over time, from its formation to the mature structure. A system is a regularly interacting or interdependent group of organs or tissues that work together to carry out a given biological process.</ns1:IAO_0000115>
        <ns2:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</ns2:hasOBONamespace>
        <ns2:id>GO:0048731</ns2:id>
