        <ns1:IAO_0000116>Discussion on OBI call 2023-05-01 resulted in an agreement to revise the textual definition of &apos;assay&apos;.  https://github.com/obi-ontology/obi/issues/1683.</ns1:IAO_0000116>
        <ns1:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">PlanAndPlannedProcess Branch</ns1:IAO_0000117>
        <ns1:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">measuring</ns1:IAO_0000118>
