        <ns1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A specimen primarily composed of a cell or cells collected from a multicellular organism or a cell culture.</ns1:IAO_0000115>
        <ns1:IAO_0000116>Discussed on obi call Jan 23, 2017. To improve cell specimen that include single cell specimen. Details see tracker: https://sourceforge.net/p/obi/obi-terms/828</ns1:IAO_0000116>
