        <ns1:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A pathologic primary tumor stage for kidney according to AJCC 7th edition indicating that the tumor grossly extends into vena cava above the diaphragm or Invades the wall of the vena cava.</ns1:IAO_0000115>
